      "name": "Cover Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-cover",
      "description": "The main way in, printed in the sheet's cover orange.",
      "html": "<a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-btn-cover\">Get started as a Parent</a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-cover{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:52px;padding:0 1.5rem;border:2px solid var(--colour-keyline,#22323d);border-radius:3px;background:var(--colour-cover,#f27a1a);color:#1a1206;font-family:'Barlow Condensed','Arial Narrow',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.3125rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms ease-out,transform 200ms ease-out}.ds-btn-cover:hover{background:var(--colour-cover-strong,#d4610a)}.ds-btn-cover:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn-cover:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--colour-map-magenta,#b8166f);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sheet Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-sheet",
      "description": "Companion home action on land paper.",
